      <p class="_abstract">You can manage the link state of a primary or secondary virtual machine (VM) interface by using the OpenShift Container Platform web console or the CLI. By specifying the link state, you can logically connect or disconnect the virtual network interface controller (vNIC) from a network.</p>
      <Alert variant="note" class="my-4">
