      <h2 id="virt-configuring-interface-link-state_virt-setting-interface-link-state" class="group scroll-mt-20">Setting the VM interface link state by using the CLI<a href="#virt-configuring-interface-link-state_virt-setting-interface-link-state" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">You can set the link state of a primary or secondary virtual machine (VM) network interface by using the CLI.</p>
