      <ul>
      <li><code>up</code>: Represents an active network connection. This is the default if no value is specified.</li>
      <li><code>down</code>: Represents a network interface link that is switched off.</li>
      <li>
      <code>absent</code>: Represents a network interface that is hot unplugged.
